WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.109
Your own sky tonight.

00:02.809 --> 00:07.130
This is your sky tonight, facing the brightest planet that is up.

00:07.580 --> 00:14.088
The planets all keep close to one line across the sky, the same path the Sun took during the day.

00:14.538 --> 00:17.680
Find one, and the others will be somewhere along it.
